description=Two removable Misc-slot gun weight kits. Light reduces firearm weight by up to 1.5; Heavy reduces by up to 5.0 for firearms with bare script weight above 5.0. Final gun and attachment weight stays at least 0.1. Equipped and hotbar burden follow native multipliers. Uses the supplied pet icon without changing gun appearance. Safely migrates legacy Sling kits when Misc is vacant. Explicit MFS-style kit tooltip. Natural loot: light kits in gun stores, police storage and military weapon storage; rare heavy kits in military weapon storage. Single-player local mod; no Workshop files replaced.
